                       login first ✓

  Your own web address, like movies.example.com, opens your chosen Apps from anywhere through
  Cloudflare Tunnel, without opening any port on your router. A login page stands in front, so
  only people you allow get in. Choose Apps after they are installed; nothing goes public without
  a separate yes.

  Before you begin
  Add your main domain to Cloudflare and wait until it is active. At one.dash.cloudflare.com
  choose a team name, the Zero Trust Free plan (50 users), and a payment method that is not
  charged. Use the main domain, not a sub-domain: deeper names need a paid certificate.

  Ownership and recovery
  Each Project keeps its own identity and resource IDs; matching names are never adopted. Backups
  keep this cleanup information. Restore disables the public connector until you review a plan and
  give a separate publication-risk yes. Use cloudflare remove with a fresh private API token for
  cleanup; ordinary connector removal is refused. Old backups without ownership need manual
  Cloudflare review. Network failures can prevent cleanup: retain the record and read the status

